id: perfect-warrior
name: Perfect Warrior
order: 13
description: >
  You are, simply, unbeatable and untouchable. None can hurt you… Right?
text: >
  Perfect Warrior: You are, simply, unbeatable and untouchable. None can hurt you… Right?
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are in the Healthy Health Threshold, increase your Defense Value and Soak Value by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: If you are in the Healthy Health Threshold, gain a stack of Overwhelm.

---

# (1)
[passive]
if (!belowThreshold("bruised")) {
    defenseValue += 1(T);
    soakValue += 1(T);
}

# (2) Healthy as your turn starts: a stack of Overwhelm. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button; set
# Triggered, ticked on the turn's card.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 2]
requires !belowThreshold("bruised");
overwhelm.stacks += 1;
